      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The quantitative measurement of plasma fibrin monomeres in three patients with Arwin-treatment by affinity chromatography on agarose fixed fibrinogen and the \"tüpfel method\" demonstrated high specifity and sensitivity. Plasmafibrinmonomer concentration clearly differs both before and during treatment from results reported in the literature. The method results in a better control of dangerous situation, especially with additional application of fibrinolytic agents."},
